    "text": "MaxPreps\nwebsite\nViroqua\nVolleyball Recap: Make It Two in a Row for Viroqua\nBy Team Reports,\n11 hours agoViroqua won the last time they faced Black River Falls and Allie Olson did her part to make sure it happened again. The Blackhawks put the hurt on the Tigers with a sharp 3-0 win on Tuesday with plenty of help from Olson, who had 16 digs and four assists. She has been hot recently, having posted 11 or more digs the last four times she's played.",
